<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ireland end-Feb EBR 205 mln punts - finance ministry.</title>
<headline>Ireland end-Feb EBR 205 mln punts - finance ministry.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's end-February Exchequer Borrowing Requirement was 205 million punts, the Finance ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
